From f1c89a23bde683c8eb14768918a0abc5007d2096 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 10:03:01 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DSi Wi-Fi chip (Atheros): first bring-up test, /proc/dsiwifi2

Step 1-3 of docs/ATHEROS-PLAN.md, run only on request:
- arm7/twlwifi.c: antenna to the Atheros chip, RTC FOUT 32 kHz clock, power
  chip reg 0x30, SCFG_WL; SDIO controller 2 (0x04004A00) set-up and polled
  commands with bounded waits (CMD5/3/7, CMD52), function 1, 4-bit bus,
  128-byte blocks; manufacturer, chip ID, "firmware loaded" flag, reset into
  the boot ROM, BMI target ID, dswifi's BMI settings, and when firmware is
  present: BMI_DONE, wait for ready, EEPROM version, first mailbox word.
  Sequence and registers after BlocksDS dswifi (MIT).
- NDS_SD_CMD_TWLWIFI request; /proc/dsiwifi2 (write runs it, read shows the
  result in words; refused while nds is up); RTC two-byte write helper.
- /boot/wifi-dsi-test, Start > Network > DSi Wi-Fi test; logbody shows it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
